    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d2-a11">

                <pb facs="0086" n="1046" xml:id="pg1046"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 11 in No.
                    223.—Translation]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Damiani to Mr. Stallo.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Ministry of Foreign Affairs</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Rome</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1888-08-02"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">August</hi> 2,
                    1888</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Mr. Minister</hi>: The documents concerning Salvatore
                    Paladini, which should have been inclosed in the note of July 27 last, were, by
                    an inadvertence, forgotten. But while I was about to send them to you, I have
                    been obliged to return them to the ministry of grace and justice, inasmuch as,
                    by a telegram dated yesterday informing me that Paladini has been arrested, they
                    have been again requested of me.</p>
                <p>Be pleased, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Damiani</hi>,<lb/><hi
                            rendition="#italic">Under Secretary of State.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
